[
  {
    "start": 2.0,
    "end": 6.439041666666666,
    "text": "Relax. It’s Arsenal. We all know how this ends."
  },
  {
    "start": 9.0,
    "end": 12.6,
    "text": "Before a ball was kicked, their runners-up medals had arrived."
  },
  {
    "start": 16.7,
    "end": 18.22,
    "text": "Same order as usual?"
  },
  {
    "start": 20.6,
    "end": 21.880000000000003,
    "text": "We haven’t played a game."
  },
  {
    "start": 22.38,
    "end": 24.299999999999997,
    "text": "Exactly. Beat the rush."
  },
  {
    "start": 28.1,
    "end": 29.3,
    "text": "Get me a striker."
  },
  {
    "start": 32.0,
    "end": 37.12,
    "text": "So they bought a striker. Someone to finish the chances."
  },
  {
    "start": 43.5,
    "end": 45.1,
    "text": "Then why am I here?"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.6,
    "end": 46.64,
    "text": "Win us a corner."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.3,
    "end": 51.14,
    "text": "Not the goal! Off him!"
  },
  {
    "start": 56.4,
    "end": 57.76,
    "text": "Now we’re dangerous."
  },
  {
    "start": 61.8,
    "end": 68.84,
    "text": "Their attacking philosophy? Win a corner. Somebody’s forehead will do the rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 72.90833333333333,
    "end": 76.90833333333333,
    "text": "ONE–NIL! That’s enough football. Everybody back!"
  },
  {
    "start": 83.29166666666667,
    "end": 90.25166666666667,
    "text": "Lovely. A goalkeeper protecting nine defenders."
  },
  {
    "start": 91.425,
    "end": 93.425,
    "text": "What am I supposed to do?"
  },
  {
    "start": 93.925,
    "end": 95.205,
    "text": "Win another corner!"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.325,
    "end": 100.845,
    "text": "Nobody is getting past us."
  },
  {
    "start": 103.325,
    "end": 103.965,
    "text": "Again?"
  },
  {
    "start": 105.825,
    "end": 110.86500000000001,
    "text": "They could defend a one–nil. They couldn’t defend a lead on the table."
  },
  {
    "start": 114.825,
    "end": 117.065,
    "text": "He’s only walking. We’re fine."
  },
  {
    "start": 122.725,
    "end": 124.565,
    "text": "WHY IS HE WALKING?"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.325,
    "end": 128.22466666666668,
    "text": "Long season, Mikel."
  },
  {
    "start": 130.025,
    "end": 133.865,
    "text": "Eyes forward! Nobody look back!"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.25,
    "end": 136.93,
    "text": "Still delivering in May?"
  },
  {
    "start": 137.43,
    "end": 138.55,
    "text": "NOT NOW!"
  },
  {
    "start": 142.35,
    "end": 143.47,
    "text": "Keep hold of the lead!"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.55,
    "end": 149.95000000000002,
    "text": "Penalty. Against Arsenal."
  },
  {
    "start": 151.43333333333334,
    "end": 154.23333333333335,
    "text": "For a penalty against Arsenal, please hold."
  },
  {
    "start": 159.43333333333334,
    "end": 162.55333333333334,
    "text": "Mikel! Straight through, as always."
  },
  {
    "start": 164.11666666666665,
    "end": 165.63666666666666,
    "text": "Can you make that go away?"
  },
  {
    "start": 167.91666666666666,
    "end": 170.87666666666667,
    "text": "Of course. Would you like a corner with that?"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.31666666666666,
    "end": 173.19666666666666,
    "text": "Make it two."
  },
  {
    "start": 176.81666666666666,
    "end": 179.12195833333334,
    "text": "Hello? I’m still here."
  },
  {
    "start": 179.6219583333333,
    "end": 181.9419583333333,
    "text": "Your call is very important to us."
  },
  {
    "start": 186.91666666666666,
    "end": 193.39666666666665,
    "text": "One goal for the title. And of course, one bloody corner."
  },
  {
    "start": 194.75,
    "end": 196.83,
    "text": "Do I finally get to shoot?"
  },
  {
    "start": 197.33,
    "end": 198.61,
    "text": "No. Stand there."
  },
  {
    "start": 200.85,
    "end": 203.25,
    "text": "There’s still time."
  },
  {
    "start": 207.725,
    "end": 210.685,
    "text": "I’m supposed to be the stri—"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.14166666666665,
    "end": 217.34166666666664,
    "text": "That counts?"
  },
  {
    "start": 217.84166666666667,
    "end": 219.28166666666667,
    "text": "Exactly as rehearsed."
  },
  {
    "start": 222.14166666666665,
    "end": 223.82166666666666,
    "text": "So… who signs for these?"
  },
  {
    "start": 224.32166666666666,
    "end": 225.60166666666666,
    "text": "Wrong address."
  },
  {
    "start": 228.04166666666666,
    "end": 228.92166666666665,
    "text": "Finally!"
  },
  {
    "start": 229.42166666666665,
    "end": 232.78166666666667,
    "text": "Thank you for waiting. The season has now ended."
  },
  {
    "start": 245.14166666666665,
    "end": 250.46054166666664,
    "text": "I SAID I WAS RETIRED! STOP GIVING ME REASONS TO COME BACK!"
  }
]